# 训练产物（模型权重、序列化状态、计算缓存）
checkpoints/*.pt
checkpoints/*.pkl
checkpoints/cache/

# ── 实验归档 runs/<tag>/（见 runs/README.md）──
# 重资产忽略、轻量索引入库：权重和图可以重跑或丢弃，但"做了什么实验、结果如何"
# 必须永久留在版本库里。历史教训是 13 组实验的训练曲线因为整目录被忽略而全部丢失。
runs/**/checkpoints/
runs/**/logs/
runs/**/elites/
runs/**/console.log
runs/_eval/*.json
# 二进制产物（权重、轨迹归档、评估视频、原始校准截图）散落在 checkpoints/ 以外的
# 子路径（best_renders/、ranks/、test_8p_iter*/、td_v2_rerank/、tas 校准 images/ 等），
# 统一按扩展名拦截；sil_seed_590.npz 是延迟探索/td_pareto/sil_comparison 的硬依赖。
runs/**/*.pt
runs/**/*.pkl
runs/**/*.npz
runs/**/*.mp4
runs/tas_anchor_calib_20260926/images/
# 评估/采样逐帧 JSON 归档（每条约 1-2 MB，148 个 deterministic 加 12 个 exploration ≈ 220 MB）：
# 结论留在 metrics.csv / summary.json / RESULT.md，底层证据按需从外部存档重算。
# 显式白名单：sil_td_sampling_plan_2026-09-28 严格依赖 test_8p_iter0123_desktop 下的那组。
runs/**/deterministic_*.json
runs/**/exploration_*.json
runs/**/original_episode.json
runs/**/episode.json
!runs/best_motion_20260923/sil_seed_590.npz
!runs/confirmed_endpoint_v2_formal_20260928/test_8p_iter0123_desktop/deterministic_*.json
!runs/**/run_meta.json
!runs/**/metrics.csv
!runs/**/RESULT.md
!runs/_eval/summary.csv
